/* 部品ギャラリーの並べ方。地の色は Web の body と同じ Mantine の暗色の面 */
/* Layout of the component gallery; the backdrop is the Mantine dark body, as on the Web */
/* Editor の既定シートは文字生成を advanced にするが、本番のランタイムパネルは既定の standard で、GameUi の SDF フォントは advanced だと描かれない。本番と同じ standard に戻す */
/* The Editor default sheet switches text generation to advanced, but the production runtime panel keeps the standard default and the GameUi SDF fonts draw nothing under advanced, so restore standard */
.ui-gallery {
    -unity-text-generator: standard;
    flex-grow: 1;
    padding: 16px;
    background-color: var(--mantine-color-body);
}

.ui-gallery__family {
    margin: 16px 0 8px 0;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--text-default);
}

.ui-gallery__row {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
}

.ui-gallery__name {
    width: 200px;
    color: var(--mantine-color-dimmed);
}
